--- !u!114 &413998383
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 413998377}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1801edba3b3a4416da2a9c28b11bafb0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  playerTag: Player
  questGiveDelay: 0
  villagerWaypoint: {fileID: 2062352011}
  waypointOffset: {x: 0, y: 2.2, z: 0}
  dialogueBox: {fileID: 1620507363}
  speakerName: Villager
  questDialogue:
  - text: By the gods... it truly is you. The warrior spoken of in the tales.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a964a00af2a6e4922a00111b19b13056, type: 3}
    displayDurationIfNoAudio: 0
    pauseAfterThisLine: 0
  - text: Forgive me for stopping you, but we are in desperate need of your strength.
      Our village has been cursed by a darkness we cannot fight alone.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0bc9c0500697648a7899acb6354d0636, type: 3}
    displayDurationIfNoAudio: 0
    pauseAfterThisLine: 0
  - text: The ancient shrines that once protected these lands have been corrupted.
      Evil spirits have taken root inside them, twisting their sacred power into
      something foul.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 160388aa5fb8e4fba97c961567992c1e, type: 3}
    displayDurationIfNoAudio: 0
    pauseAfterThisLine: 0
  - text: There are three shrines... three places where these spirits now dwell.
      Each one grows stronger by the day, spreading their corruption across the land.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 93186a287650847f389976b6517df414, type: 3}
    displayDurationIfNoAudio: 0
    pauseAfterThisLine: 0
  - text: Please, mighty warrior. We ask for your help. Cleanse these shrines, defeat
      the spirits that haunt them, and restore the protection our people have lost.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9af75be2bf9454e69a8c9ff81790ddd7, type: 3}
    displayDurationIfNoAudio: 0
    pauseAfterThisLine: 0
  - text: If anyone can free us from this darkness... it is you.
    audioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f0585d7b6fc6a4bde8bb1dbd5bd56121, type: 3}
    displayDurationIfNoAudio: 0
    pauseAfterThisLine: 0
